SUMMARY:Panigiri of Panagia Galatiani\, Arginonta
LOCATION:Arginonta\, Kalymnos\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:The alternative 15 August on Kalymnos\, for the Masouri/Arginonta side of the island: the chapel of Panagia Galatiani in the Arginonta valley has a vigil and then a glendi with local musicians\, an easier option than the climb to Kyra Psili and popular with the climbing crowd staying in Masouri. Ten minutes from Masouri by scooter.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/kalymnos/#arginonta-panigiri-of-panagia-galatiani-arginonta
